  availableTopics:
  - topicName: You two should introduce yourselves.
    requiredDay: 0
    requiredStoryFlags:
    - Lily_Pondered
    excludedStoryFlags: []
    flagsToSet: []
    requiredPreviousTopic: 
    lines:
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000}
      text: "Oh, yeah. Hi, I\u2019m Lily."
      effect: 0
      bonusGold: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: caacd43d847d12f4896590de52824cb9, type: 2}
      text: Steph.
      effect: 0
      bonusGold: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a117d69041774e64883c4a1f3ddec85b, type: 2}
      text: (They're just talking...nothing I don't already know. I clean the counter
        for a bit...)
      effect: 0
      bonusGold: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a117d69041774e64883c4a1f3ddec85b, type: 2}
      text: (After some time...)
      effect: 0
      bonusGold: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: caacd43d847d12f4896590de52824cb9, type: 2}
      text: "I\u2019m really sorry about the guild..."
      effect: 0
      bonusGold: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: caacd43d847d12f4896590de52824cb9, type: 2}
      text: Once again, I sit here wishing I could do something about it.
      effect: 0
      bonusGold: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000}
      text: Well... I am starting up a new guild. I could always use a new member.
      effect: 0
      bonusGold: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: caacd43d847d12f4896590de52824cb9, type: 2}
      text: "I\u2019m not sure how much help I\u2019d be, I\u2019m not really the
        adventuring type."
      effect: 0
      bonusGold: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000}
      text: Yes but... as you said, you know the birds personally
      effect: 0
      bonusGold: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000}
      text: I think we can do something more than just help the community.
      effect: 0
      bonusGold: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: caacd43d847d12f4896590de52824cb9, type: 2}
      text: "I see... I\u2019m really not sure. What if it all fails and things are
        worse than they were before?"
      effect: 0
      bonusGold: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000}
      text: Well do you want to help or not?
      effect: 1
      bonusGold: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: caacd43d847d12f4896590de52824cb9, type: 2}
      text: I do, I just-
      effect: 0
      bonusGold: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000}
      text: "If you want to actually help and \u201Catone\u201D for whatever you
        think you did, the opportunity is right here."
      effect: 0
      bonusGold: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000}
      text: We kick the birds out, we bring the forest back to normal, my friend
        gets their potion shop back.
      effect: 0
      bonusGold: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000}
      text: And I get to adventure normally again.
      effect: 0
      bonusGold: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: caacd43d847d12f4896590de52824cb9, type: 2}
      text: "I\u2019ll do it... I\u2019ll join this new adventurer's guild."
      effect: 0
      bonusGold: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000}
      text: "That\u2019s what I\u2019m talking about! You won\u2019t regret it."
      effect: 1
      bonusGold: 0
  - topicName: "How is the new adventurer\u2019s guild doing?"
    requiredDay: 0
    requiredStoryFlags:
    - Lily_Pondered
    excludedStoryFlags: []
    flagsToSet: []
    requiredPreviousTopic: 
    lines:
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000}
      text: "As I said before, It\u2019s not doing too bad."
      effect: 0
      bonusGold: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000}
      text: "Issue is, I think one of stalker bird\u2019s guards saw me talking about
        it."
      effect: 0
      bonusGold: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: caacd43d847d12f4896590de52824cb9, type: 2}
      text: In that case you have 2 days.
      effect: 0
      bonusGold: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000}
      text: Huh?
      effect: 0
      bonusGold: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: caacd43d847d12f4896590de52824cb9, type: 2}
      text: The guards report all incidents of the week on the last day of said week.
      effect: 0
      bonusGold: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: caacd43d847d12f4896590de52824cb9, type: 2}
      text: Action is taken immediately after.
      effect: 0
      bonusGold: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000}
      text: ... Well so much for slowly gaining trust by helping the community.
      effect: 0
      bonusGold: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a117d69041774e64883c4a1f3ddec85b, type: 2}
      text: If you need help fleeing the forest, let me know in advance.
      effect: 0
      bonusGold: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000}
      text: Nah, it just means I need to work faster.
      effect: 0
      bonusGold: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a117d69041774e64883c4a1f3ddec85b, type: 2}
      text: Mind telling me what the actual plan is?
      effect: 0
      bonusGold: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000}
      text: "It\u2019s a surprise that will help us later."
      effect: 0
      bonusGold: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000}
      text: What matters is that I need to be all around town tonight and tomorrow.
      effect: 1
      bonusGold: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a117d69041774e64883c4a1f3ddec85b, type: 2}
      text: What do you two want to drink?
      effect: 0
      bonusGold: 0
  - topicName: What do you two want to drink?
    requiredDay: 0
    requiredStoryFlags:
    - Lily_Pondered
    excludedStoryFlags: []
    flagsToSet: []
    requiredPreviousTopic: 
    lines:
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000}
      text: I cannot express enough how little the actual beverage matters to me.
      effect: 0
      bonusGold: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: caacd43d847d12f4896590de52824cb9, type: 2}
      text: "I guess I\u2019ll just take what I had last time."
      effect: 0
      bonusGold: 0
  - topicName: You two should introduce yourselves.
    requiredDay: 0
